<p class="asof" style="margin:0 0 12px">${S(`V\u0161echny zdroje ov\u011B\u0159eny ${zn}. Superhuman je ochrann\xE1 zn\xE1mka sv\xE9ho vlastn\xEDka; jm\xE9no pou\u017E\xEDv\xE1me jen k ozna\u010Den\xED produktu a mailmcp s n\xEDm nen\xED spojen\xFD.`,`All sources checked on ${Rn}. Superhuman is a trademark of its owner; the name is used only to identify the product, and mailmcp is not affiliated with it.`)}</p>
